: "1288205531608958", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003281_1288205534942291_6447482674783543975_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=owh10eTZVfIQ7kNvwGpMa8a&_nc_oc=Ado-JFMP0wHNv69HAIY7FfJfGLHFfnwWK8EXrQHdo9mZk7PXlvE_dz8XLRFV78mI5kE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXYCtzseP9311QVjs0VC2Fr3CD5VGa9MI8tGvL-uh-uZA&oe=6B105CC5"}, "display_name": "Miro", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Miro unlocks creativity with:\n\n- An infinite canvas to help you ideate, strategize, get organized, and work with your team without constraints\n- Whiteboarding tools like sticky notes, a pen, shapes, arrows, and smart drawing that let you easily co-create\n- 200+ best-practice templates to help you easily facilitate brainstorming, Agile rituals, design-thinking activities, and strategic planning\n- Integrations with your favorite tools including Dropbox, Box, Google Suite, JIRA, Slack, and Sketch to streamline your workflows and see the big picture of your projects", "short_description": "Miro is the online whiteboard for team collaboration. With the magic of Miro, visualizing concepts, ideas, and solutions as a team can happen anywhere, any time. Miro helps teams sync, flow, and feel the connection of working side by side \u2014 even in remote, distributed, and hybrid work environments."}]}, "developer_name": "Miro", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://miro.com/legal/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://miro.com/legal/terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Miro", "support_website_url": "https://help.miro.com/hc/en-us", "website_url": "https://www.miro.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": ["PRODUCTIVITY", "UTILITY", "ART_CREATIVITY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRE